  m_text: "<color=#00FFFF>G\xDCVENL\u0130 YAPI \u0130N\u015EA KR\u0130TERLER\u0130</color>\r\n\r\n<color=orange>1.
    Sa\u011Flam Temel Kural\u0131:</color>\r\nDo\u011Frudan toprak \xFCzerine yap\u0131
    kurulamaz. Zemin mutlaka en az 1 katman '\xC7imento' blo\u011Fu ile at\u0131lmal\u0131d\u0131r.\r\n\r\n<color=orange>2.
    Ta\u015F\u0131y\u0131c\u0131 Sistem (Kolonlar):</color>\r\nYap\u0131n\u0131n
    4 k\xF6\u015Fesinde mutlaka 'Demir' ile g\xFC\xE7lendirilmi\u015F beton kolonlar
    bulunmak zorundad\u0131r. Tu\u011Fla tek ba\u015F\u0131na ta\u015F\u0131y\u0131c\u0131
    olamaz.\r\n\r\n<color=orange>3. Y\xFCk ve Kat S\u0131n\u0131r\u0131:</color>\r\nStandart
    temel ile maksimum 2 kat \xE7\u0131k\u0131labilir. A\u011F\u0131r tu\u011Fla
    bloklar alt katlarda, hafif malzemeler \xFCst katlarda kullan\u0131lmal\u0131d\u0131r."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 12f62981dfb213842850b07660d05acb, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 1309802570192972294, guid: 12f62981dfb213842850b07660d05acb, type: 2}
